                        ],
                        "form": "fringantes"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "443b8c97-890a-3f0d-8c0c-b43d85e61eac",
                        "entry_id": "b996a841-5802-392e-8e27-789f8ad95dfe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alerte, éveillé, d’allure vive et élégante, en parlant d’un cheval."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Hippologie"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4d4e4c7d-c656-4b10-bb25-8f749b4bee76",
                                "sense_id": "443b8c97-890a-3f0d-8c0c-b43d85e61eac",
                                "text": "Le Prince les inspecta, comme s’il eût passé une revue, à cheval sur un fringant coursier."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "14426889-12f6-4f00-9583-78a44eefbdb0",
                                "sense_id": "443b8c97-890a-3f0d-8c0c-b43d85e61eac",
                                "text": "Durant ces quelques minutes de préparation, le maquignon a le soin d’énumérer toutes ses qualités : son ardeur, si l’on veut une bête fringante ; sa docilité, si l’on désire un cheval de dame ou de famille."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1afad35f-667d-3898-80d6-d0bb62e34894",
                        "entry_id": "b996a841-5802-392e-8e27-789f8ad95dfe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Pétulant, vif, à la présentation avantageuse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "broadly"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4557d48a-9ada-4c66-9a02-0ff7fa8a5dd6",
                                "sense_id": "1afad35f-667d-3898-80d6-d0bb62e34894",
                                "text": "Par compensation, un beau surnuméraire, jeune de ses fringants dix-neuf ans, apparaît à une dévote dans le simple appareil d’un homme qui se barbifie."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "79586cec-7329-4bca-b4a2-76aff87a55f0",
                                "sense_id": "1afad35f-667d-3898-80d6-d0bb62e34894",
                                "text": "Il comprendra tout de suite que vous n’hésitiez pas entre un Parisien fringant et Eugène Duthoit !"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0f7b6653-811f-474a-b63d-3f49072414c2",
                        "source_entry_id": "b996a841-5802-392e-8e27-789f8ad95dfe",
                        "target_lang_word": "lively",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "lively",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6099874a-f454-3ebe-b1cb-bac946c0b61e",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed3e33-6c0c-3e1f-bf07-d04df526ef98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Full of life; energetic, vivacious."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cb7891f2-d88b-431f-a009-b6685284e316",
                                                "sense_id": "6099874a-f454-3ebe-b1cb-bac946c0b61e",
                                                "text": "But wherefore comes old Manoa in such haſt, / With youthful ſteps? much livelier then e're while / He ſeems."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a1e58d4e-4df3-4771-8930-fc0a43f1e84b",
                                                "sense_id": "6099874a-f454-3ebe-b1cb-bac946c0b61e",
                                                "text": "[...] St. Bede's at this period of its history was perhaps the poorest and most miserable parish in the East End of London. Close-packed, crushed by the buttressed height of railway viaducts, rendered airless by huge walls of factories, it at once banished lively interest from a stranger's mind and left only a dull oppression of the spirit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "41fc4f77-ee9d-4344-8e3d-6fbb7a850332",
                                                "sense_id": "6099874a-f454-3ebe-b1cb-bac946c0b61e",
                                                "text": "Since sick people were apt to be present, he could not always depend on a lively young crowd in the same ward with him, and the entertainment was not always good."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02da16ae-aa58-4510-8980-bb1e8dcfd594",
                                                "sense_id": "6099874a-f454-3ebe-b1cb-bac946c0b61e",
                                                "text": "But with the lively [Giovani] Dos Santos pulling the strings behind strikers [Roman] Pavlyuchenko and [Jermain] Defoe, Spurs controlled the first half without finding the breakthrough their dominance deserved."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "99b6322a-5d53-3601-9365-afd4e82d1b79",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed3e33-6c0c-3e1f-bf07-d04df526ef98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Bright, glowing, vivid; strong, vigorous."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2070d39a-eb83-40ac-ac6a-9d466a3dd8fa",
                                                "sense_id": "99b6322a-5d53-3601-9365-afd4e82d1b79",
                                                "text": "The colours of the prism are manifestly more full, intense, and lively that those of natural bodies."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea1906ec-d766-4850-9d03-b513f7cd418a",
                                                "sense_id": "99b6322a-5d53-3601-9365-afd4e82d1b79",
                                                "text": "His faith must be not only living, but lively too."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "243e164b-7b2d-3eae-abca-9b01e59b78fb",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed3e33-6c0c-3e1f-bf07-d04df526ef98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Endowed with or manifesting life; living."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b88f176a-dcbc-404c-837d-48eece4288c4",
                                                "sense_id": "243e164b-7b2d-3eae-abca-9b01e59b78fb",
                                                "text": "c. 1600, Philemon Holland\nchaplets of gold and silver resembling lively flowers and leaves"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4138a22-b3a5-3ba4-b70c-10e048a49d53",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed3e33-6c0c-3e1f-bf07-d04df526ef98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Representing life; lifelike."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8d04d7c-449c-4a18-af99-d160fb12fba4",
                                                "sense_id": "d4138a22-b3a5-3ba4-b70c-10e048a49d53",
                                                "text": "I spied the lively picture of my father."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1ef5bf24-724d-32e5-84cc-96f4592de655",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed3e33-6c0c-3e1f-bf07-d04df526ef98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Airy; animated; spirited."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b81fe85f-f2e8-4cf8-b446-012e390a70a7",
                                                "sense_id": "1ef5bf24-724d-32e5-84cc-96f4592de655",
                                                "text": "From grave to gay, from lively to ſevere, [...]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d614b53e-1f83-3ff7-a135-856652d56095",
                                        "entry_id": "2bed3e33-6c0c-3e1f-bf07-d04df526ef98",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fizzy; foamy; tending to produce a large head in the glass."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of beer"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
